      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report a case of a 77-year old female patient with abdominal pain in the upper right part. In the computertomography we had the suspicion of a rare small bowel diverticulitis which was confirmed in laparoscopic and histopathologic diagnostics. After surgical excision the patient was free of symptoms."},
